# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ceja Farms — what stays out of the repo
#
# The site itself (HTML/CSS/JS, images/, video/) IS tracked, because those are
# the files that get deployed. What's excluded below is source material and
# machine cruft.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw camera/drone masters. The web-ready encodes in /video are committed; these
# ~47 MB originals are the inputs they were cut from. Keep them backed up
# somewhere else. To track one anyway: git add -f "pulling vinyards.MP4"
/Moving debree.MP4
/Moving equiptment.MP4
/pulling vinyards.MP4

# Unextracted photo drops
images/*.zip

# OS / file-manager droppings
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Tooling, if it ever lands here
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.local
